{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Building 17</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998250/extras/4b50f5fc2f090aecc541d53315faa213.avif?t=1771094997\" width=1560 height=735 /></span>is a first-person indie horror game in the walking simulator genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The average time to complete the game is 55 minutes. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Northern Russia, amidst the fog, there's a gloomy city. Norilsk is the most gloomy city in the world, with intense cold and bad weather. Many locals talk about Building 17, which houses foreign workers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many mysterious and terrifying things happen in the building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a lot of mysterious, scary storeys about this building in the neighborhood</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new worker who came to the area and doesn't know anything, the worker wants to rent a cheap room. He found a poster in the street about a cheap room in the building 17 , The worker called the number and the owner offered him a very cheap room </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the worker crossed the building, he realised there was something wrong; there was mystery in everywhere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He discovered that the owner was calling people to rent a room, then kidnapping, filming, and killing them. He then sold all the videos on the dark web.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998250/extras/cdd2fc61ac6a8cfc6beec4e7094b11fd.avif?t=1771094997\" width=1560 height=754 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to visit a frightening place inhabited by creepy personalities.<br>Beautiful graphics and high quality 3D sound will help you to fully experience the atmosphere of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998250/extras/e761ad8b72d7ad0eae99d43b21231f11.poster.avif?t=1771094997\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998250/extras/e761ad8b72d7ad0eae99d43b21231f11.webm?t=1771094997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998250/extras/e761ad8b72d7ad0eae99d43b21231f11.mp4?t=1771094997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ATTENTION!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is very scary and contains flashes of light that can cause epileptic seizures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3998250?t=1771094997","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3998250?t=1771094997","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998250/fc6c92b2d676d51bf4e3d1098a1154877e1ec833/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1771094997","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998250/fc6c92b2d676d51bf4e3d1098a1154877e1ec833/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1771094997","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game has some blood and dead body , and scary characters\r\nalso it contains flashes of light and some jampscary that can caus